<title>USA: Wells-Gardner says IBEW ratifies contract.</title>
<headline>Wells-Gardner says IBEW ratifies contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wells-Gardner Electronics Corp said Monday union members of Local 1031 of the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers ratified a new labor contract which runs through June 30, 2000.</p>
<p>The contract covers 130 workers at the company's plant in Chicago. The previous contract expired July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Wells-Gardner manufactures monitors for the amusement, gaming, leisure and fitness, automotive, INTRANET and video wall markets.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
